    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "flop",
      "label": "flop",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "board_shown",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[board[0], board[1], board[2]]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Flop: {board_shown}. Pot: {pot}. Chips [seat, chips]: {[[p.seat, p.chips] for p in players]}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "flop",
      "label": "flop bet",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.in_hand and you.chips > 0"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "min_bet"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "min(max_bet, you.chips)"
        }
      },
      "store": "bet",
      "text": "Flop bet. Board so far: {board_shown}. Pot: {pot}. Secretly bet a whole number of chips from {min_bet} to {max_bet}, no more than your own chips. All bets are revealed together and paid into the pot; anyone who bet less than the largest bet must then call or fold."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "flop",
      "label": "flop bets revealed",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.bet for p in players if p.in_hand])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand"
            },
            "key": "chips",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-you.bet"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bet",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bet for p in players if p.in_hand] + [0])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "decision",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Flop bets [seat, bet]: {[[p.seat, p.bet] for p in players if p.in_hand]}. Largest bet H = {high_bet}. Pot: {pot}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "flop",
      "label": "flop call or fold",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.in_hand and you.bet < high_bet"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "call",
          "fold"
        ]
      },
      "store": "decision",
      "text": "The largest flop bet is {high_bet} and your bet was lower. Call: pay the difference so your bet equals {high_bet} (or all your chips if you have fewer) and stay in the hand. Fold: leave this hand; chips you already put in stay in the pot."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "flop",
      "label": "flop calls resolved",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "paid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(high_bet - you.bet, you.chips) if (you.in_hand and you.decision == 'call') else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.paid for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "chips",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-you.paid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bet",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.paid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand and you.decision == 'fold'"
            },
            "key": "in_hand",
            "value": false,
            "text": "Seat {player} folds."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "in_hand_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_hand for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand"
            },
            "key": "chips",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pot"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count == 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} is the only player left in the hand and takes the whole pot."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": 0,
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count == 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Flop betting closed. Players still in the hand: {in_hand_count}. Pot: {pot}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "river",
      "label": "turn and river",
      "when": {
        "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "board_shown",
            "value": {
              "calc": "board"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bet",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bet",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Turn and river: the full board is {board_shown}. Pot: {pot}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "river",
      "label": "river bet",
      "when": {
        "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.in_hand and you.chips > 0"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "min_bet"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "min(max_bet, you.chips)"
        }
      },
      "store": "bet",
      "text": "River bet. Full board: {board_shown}. Pot: {pot}. Secretly bet a whole number of chips from {min_bet} to {max_bet}, no more than your own chips. All bets are revealed together and paid into the pot; anyone who bet less than the largest bet must then call or fold."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "river",
      "label": "river bets revealed",
      "when": {
        "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.bet for p in players if p.in_hand])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand"
            },
            "key": "chips",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-you.bet"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bet",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bet for p in players if p.in_hand] + [0])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "decision",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "River bets [seat, bet]: {[[p.seat, p.bet] for p in players if p.in_hand]}. Largest bet H = {high_bet}. Pot: {pot}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "river",
      "label": "river call or fold",
      "when": {
        "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.in_hand and you.bet < high_bet"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "call",
          "fold"
        ]
      },
      "store": "decision",
      "text": "The largest river bet is {high_bet} and your bet was lower. Call: pay the difference so your bet equals {high_bet} (or all your chips if you have fewer) and stay in the hand. Fold: leave this hand; chips you already put in stay in the pot."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "showdown",
      "label": "showdown",
      "when": {
        "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "paid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(high_bet - you.bet, you.chips) if (you.in_hand and you.decision == 'call') else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.paid for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "chips",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-you.paid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bet",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.paid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand and you.decision == 'fold'"
            },
            "key": "in_hand",
            "value": false,
            "text": "Seat {player} folds."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "in_hand_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_hand for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand"
            },
            "key": "chips",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pot"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count == 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} is the only player left in the hand and takes the whole pot."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": 0,
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand"
            },
            "key": "shown_hole",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hole"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand"
            },
            "key": "strength",
            "value": {
              "calc": "match_weight * min(count(b in you.hole for b in board), max_matches) + pair_bonus * (1 if you.hole[0] == you.hole[1] else 0) + you.hole[0] + you.hole[1]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_strength",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.strength for p in players if p.in_hand] + [0])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winners_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_hand and p.strength == best_strength for p in players)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_hand and you.strength == best_strength"
            },
            "key": "chips",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(pot / winners_count)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2 and winners_count >= 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the highest strength and takes a share of the pot."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pot - winners_count * int(pot / winners_count)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "in_hand_count >= 2 and winners_count >= 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Showdown. Shown hole cards [seat, cards, strength]: {[[p.seat, p.shown_hole, p.strength] for p in players if p.in_hand]}. Best strength: {best_strength}, shared by {winners_count}. Pot left over: {pot}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "elimination",
      "label": "elimination",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "(not you.out) and you.chips <= elimination_chips"
            },
            "key": "in_hand",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": {
              "where": "(not you.out) and you.chips <= elimination_chips"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "text": "Seat {player} has no chips left and is eliminated."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "out",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.out or you.chips <= elimination_chips"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "alive_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(not p.out for p in players)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "End of hand {hand_no}. Chips [seat, chips, eliminated]: {[[p.seat, p.chips, p.out] for p in players]}. Players still in the game: {alive_count}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "elimination",
      "label": "is the game over",
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_no >= hands or alive_count <= 1"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_no >= hands or alive_count <= 1"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.chips",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final chips [seat, chips]: {[[p.seat, p.chips] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 15,
    "rounds_max": 15,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Each player starts with {starting_chips} chips. The deck has {deck_size} cards: values {card_value_min} to {card_value_max}, {copies_per_value} copies of each value. The game lasts {hands} hands. There is no dealer or acting order; every decision is made simultaneously.\n\nEACH HAND:\n1. Ante and deal. Every player still in the game puts {ante} chip into the pot (a player with only 1 chip is then all-in and stays in the hand). The deck is shuffled. Each player is dealt {hole_cards} hole cards, seen only by that player, and {board_cards} board cards are set face down. Any pot left over from the previous hand stays in the pot.\n2. Flop. The first {flop_cards} board cards are revealed to everyone.\n3. Flop bet. Every player in the hand secretly chooses a bet of {min_bet} to {max_bet} chips (never more than their stack; a player with 0 chips bets 0). All bets are revealed together and paid into the pot. Call the largest bet H.\n4. Flop call or fold. Each player whose bet was less than H chooses simultaneously: CALL: pay the difference so their bet equals H; if they have fewer chips, they pay their whole stack and stay in. FOLD: they are out of this hand, and chips already put in stay in the pot. Players who bet H stay in automatically.\n5. If only one player remains in the hand, they take the whole pot and the hand ends (skip to step 10).\n6. Turn and river. Board cards 4 and 5 are revealed.\n7. River bet. The same as step 3, with bets starting again from 0: a simultaneous secret bet of {min_bet} to {max_bet} chips by every player still in the hand.\n8. River call or fold. The same as step 4.\n9. Showdown. If only one player remains, they take the pot. Otherwise every remaining player reveals their hole cards and their Strength is computed: matches = the number of the {board_cards} board cards whose value equals either of the player's hole card values (if both hole cards share a value, a board card of that value counts once); matches counts at most {max_matches}; pair = 1 if the two hole cards have the same value, else 0. Strength = {match_weight} x min(matches, {max_matches}) + {pair_bonus} x pair + hole card 1 value + hole card 2 value. The highest Strength takes the pot. If several players tie for highest, the pot is split equally among them in whole chips, and any leftover chip stays in the pot for the next hand.\n10. Elimination. Any player with {elimination_chips} chips is eliminated and takes no further part.\n\nEND: The game ends after hand {hands}, or earlier if only one player has chips left. The player with the most chips wins; players tied for the most chips share the win."
}
